# CQ5 – What is the Wikidata identifier and Tate web page of a given artist?
PREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>
PREFIX owl:    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?artist ?wikidata ?tatePage WHERE {
  ?artist schema:name "Abbey, Edwin Austin" ;     # change the name to look up another artist
          schema:url ?tatePage .
  OPTIONAL { ?artist owl:sameAs ?wikidata }
}
